n-300 hover:bg-brand-800 lg:inline-flex\" href=\"/career\">加入我們<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"開啟選單\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center border border-brand-900/20 text-brand-900 transition hover:bg-brand-900 hover:text-ivory lg:hidden\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none\">☰</span></button></div></header><main><section id=\"hero\" class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-900 pt-20 text-ivory\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\"><div class=\"absolute left-[8%] top-0 h-full w-px bg-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"absolute right-[8%] top-0 h-full w-px bg-white/[0.05]\"></div></div><div class=\"container-shell relative flex min-h-[760px] items-center py-12 md:min-h-[820px] md:py-16 lg:min-h-[700px] lg:py-20\"><div class=\"grid w-full gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] lg:items-end lg:gap-20\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-10 bg-gold\"></span><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.28em] text-brand-200\">JOIN GOOD ANGEL</p></div><h1 class=\"mt-6 max-w-4xl text-[clamp(2.5rem,4.5vw,4.75rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.04em]\">和一群對的人，<br/><span class=\"text-brand-200\">做值得成長的事。</span></h1><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-white/65 md:text-lg md:leading-9\">好天使不動產財商團隊結合不動產實務、財商教育與人才培育， 透過專業學習與團隊陪伴，讓不同背景的夥伴建立自己的專業能力與職涯方向。</p><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-between gap-10 bg-[#c7d98f] px-7 py-4 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-[#1f3326] transition duration-300 hover:bg-[#dbe8b4]\" href=\"/career\"><span>加入好天使</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-between gap-10 border border-white/25 bg-transparent px-7 py-4 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-white/90 transition duration-300 hover:border-brand-200 hover:bg-brand-200 hover:text-brand-900\" href=\"/about\"><span>認識我們</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-white/15 pt-8 lg:border-l lg:border-t-0 lg:pl-10 lg:pt-0\"><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-gold\">WHAT WE BELIEVE</p><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-md text-xl font-medium leading-[1.55] tracking-tight text-white md:text-2xl lg:text-3xl\">專業可以學習，<br/>經驗可以累積，<br/>而成長需要一群<span class=\"text-brand-200\"> 願意同行的人。</span></p><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-white/40\">REAL ESTATE</span><span class=\"h-px w-6 bg-white/20\"></span><span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-white/40\">FINANCE</span><span class=\"h-px w-6 bg-white/20\"></span><span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-white/40\">GROWTH</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-6 left-1/2 hidden -translate-x-1/2 items-center gap-3 text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] text-white/35 md:flex\"><span>SCROLL TO DISCOVER</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></div></section><section class=\"bg-ivory\"><div class=\"container-shell section-space\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 border-b border-brand-900/15 pb-16 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr] lg:gap-20\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold\"></span><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-gold\">ABOUT GOOD ANGEL</p></div><p class=\"mt-6 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">不動產 × 財商 × 人才培育</p></div><div><h2 class=\"max-w-4xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.35] tracking-[-0.03em] text-brand-900 md:text-5xl md:leading-[1.25]\">我們不只分享知識，<br/>更希望陪伴每一位夥伴<span class=\"text-brand-600\"> 建立自己的專業。</span></h2><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-3xl text-base leading-8 text-muted md:text-lg md:leading-9\">好天使不動產財商團隊結合不動產實務、財商教育與人才培育， 透過學習、交流與實務經驗的累積，讓不同背景的夥伴逐步理解產業， 建立判斷能力，也找到屬於自己的成長方向。</p></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3\"><article class=\"group border-b border-brand-900/15 py-10 md:border-b-0 md:border-r md:px-8 md:py-14 md:first:pl-0 md:last:border-r-0 md:last:pr-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">01</span><span class=\"text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] text-muted/70\">REAL ESTATE</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-900 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-brand-600\">不動產實務</h3><p class=\"mt-5 leading-8 text-muted\">從市場資訊、物件分析到實際購屋流程，在真實案例中逐步建立對不動產市場的理解與判斷能力。</p><div class=\"mt-10 h-px w-8 bg-gold transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-16\"></div></article><article class=\"group border-b border-brand-900/15 py-10 md:border-b-0 md:border-r md:px-8 md:py-14 md:first:pl-0 md:last:border-r-0 md:last:pr-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">02</span><span class=\"text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] text-muted/70\">FINANCIAL LITERACY</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-900 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-brand-600\">財商思維</h3><p class=\"mt-5 leading-8 text-muted\">理解稅務、資產配置與財務規劃的基本邏輯，把零散的知識轉化成能實際運用的專業能力。</p><div class=\"mt-10 h-px w-8 bg-gold transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-16\"></div></article><article class=\"group border-b border-brand-900/15 py-10 md:border-b-0 md:border-r md:px-8 md:py-14 md:first:pl-0 md:last:border-r-0 md:last:pr-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">03</span><span class=\"text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] text-muted/70\">PROFESSIONAL GROWTH</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-900 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-brand-600\">專業成長</h3><p class=\"mt-5 leading-8 text-muted\">透過團隊交流、經驗分享與持續學習，在累積實務經驗的同時，探索適合自己的職涯發展方向。</p><div class=\"mt-10 h-px w-8 bg-gold transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-16\"></div></article></div><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-8 border-t border-brand-900/15 pt-12 md:mt-0 md:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] md:pt-16\"><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.22em] text-gold\">OUR PURPOSE</p><p class=\"max-w-4xl text-xl font-medium leading-[1.8] text-brand-900 md:text-2xl\">我們相信，一個人的起點不代表終點。<span class=\"text-brand-600\"> <!-- -->願意學習、願意累積、願意與團隊一起前進，</span>就有機會走出自己的專業道路。</p></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-paper\"><div class=\"container-shell section-space\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr] lg:gap-20\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold\"></span><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-gold\">WHY GOOD ANGEL</p></div><p class=\"mt-6 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">Learning · Practice · Teamwork · Growth</p></div><div><h2 class=\"max-w-4xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.35] tracking-[-0.03em] text-brand-900 md:text-5xl md:leading-[1.25]\">一份工作的價值，<br/>不只在今天做了什麼，<br/><span class=\"text-brand-600\">也在明天成為什麼樣的人。</span></h2><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-3xl text-base leading-8 text-muted md:text-lg\">我們重視知識的累積，也重視實務經驗與團隊交流。 在好天使，每一次學習與參與，都能成為建立專業能力的一部分。</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-16 border-t border-brand-900/15 md:mt-20\"><article class=\"group grid gap-6 border-b border-brand-900/15 py-9 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-brand-100/40 md:grid-cols-[0.15fr_0.25fr_0.6fr] md:items-start md:px-5 md:py-12\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">01</span><div><p class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-muted\">LEARNING</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-900 md:text-2xl\">從學習開始</h3></div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-8\"><p class=\"max-w-2xl leading-8 text-muted\">透過不動產、財商與市場相關知識的累積，逐步建立對產業的理解，讓專業不是背答案，而是真的知道如何判斷。</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden text-xl text-gold transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 md:block\">→</span></div></article><article class=\"group grid gap-6 border-b border-brand-900/15 py-9 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-brand-100/40 md:grid-cols-[0.15fr_0.25fr_0.6fr] md:items-start md:px-5 md:py-12\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">02</span><div><p class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-muted\">PRACTICE</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-900 md:text-2xl\">從實務累積經驗</h3></div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-8\"><p class=\"max-w-2xl leading-8 text-muted\">把學到的觀念帶進真實案例與工作情境，在一次次接觸與討論中，累積屬於自己的實務經驗。</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden text-xl text-gold transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 md:block\">→</span></div></article><article class=\"group grid gap-6 border-b border-brand-900/15 py-9 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-brand-100/40 md:grid-cols-[0.15fr_0.25fr_0.6fr] md:items-start md:px-5 md:py-12\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">03</span><div><p class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-muted\">TEAMWORK</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-900 md:text-2xl\">和團隊一起前進</h3></div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-8\"><p class=\"max-w-2xl leading-8 text-muted\">透過交流、經驗分享與彼此協作，讓遇到的問題不必只靠自己摸索，也讓不同背景的經驗能彼此成為養分。</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden text-xl text-gold transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 md:block\">→</span></div></article><article class=\"group grid gap-6 border-b border-brand-900/15 py-9 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-brand-100/40 md:grid-cols-[0.15fr_0.25fr_0.6fr] md:items-start md:px-5 md:py-12\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">04</span><div><p class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-muted\">GROWTH</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-900 md:text-2xl\">找到自己的發展方向</h3></div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-8\"><p class=\"max-w-2xl leading-8 text-muted\">在持續學習與實務累積的過程中，更了解自己的能力與興趣，逐步探索適合自己的專業與職涯方向。</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden text-xl text-gold transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 md:block\">→</span></div></article></div><div class=\"mt-20 bg-brand-900 px-7 py-12 text-ivory md:px-12 md:py-16 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] lg:items-end\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-gold\">GROW WITH US</p><h3 class=\"mt-6 max-w-3xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.35] tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-5xl\">我們尋找的，<br/>不只是已經準備好的人。</h3></div><div><p class=\"max-w-xl leading-8 text-white/65\">比起一開始就什麼都會，我們更期待願意理解產業、持續學習， 並且願意與團隊共同累積經驗的夥伴。</p><div class=\"mt-8 h-px w-16 bg-gold\"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"team\" class=\"bg-ivory\"><div class=\"container-shell section-space\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr] lg:gap-20\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold\"></span><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-gold\">OUR PEOPLE</p></div><p class=\"mt-6 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">People · Knowledge · Collaboration</p></div><div><h2 class=\"max-w-4xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.35] tracking-[-0.03em] text-brand-900 md:text-5xl md:leading-[1.25]\">每一份專業背後，<br/>都是一群願意<span class=\"text-brand-600\"> 分享與同行的人。</span></h2><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-3xl text-base leading-8 text-muted md:text-lg\">好天使匯聚不同經驗與專業背景的夥伴。 我們相信，好的團隊不是每個人都一樣， 而是能讓不同能力彼此交流、互相學習，一起把事情做好。</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-16 grid gap-x-6 gap-y-14 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:gap-x-8\"><article class=\"group\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-brand-100\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-600/50\">TEAM PHOTO</span></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-1/3 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-900/20 to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-5 right-5 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/40 bg-white/10 text-sm text-white opacity-0 backdrop-blur-sm transition duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100\">↗</div></div><div class=\"border-b border-brand-900/15 pb-7 pt-6\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><p class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">不動產財商教育</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-900\">創辦人</h3></div><span class=\"pt-1 text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] text-muted/50\">01</span></div><p class=\"mt-4 line-clamp-3 leading-7 text-muted\">...</p></div></article><article class=\"group\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-brand-100\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-600/50\">TEAM PHOTO</span></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-1/3 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-900/20 to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-5 right-5 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/40 bg-white/10 text-sm text-white opacity-0 backdrop-blur-sm transition duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100\">↗</div></div><div class=\"border-b border-brand-900/15 pb-7 pt-6\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><p class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">實務陪伴與學習支持</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-900\">專業教練團隊</h3></div><span class=\"pt-1 text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] text-muted/50\">02</span></div><p class=\"mt-4 line-clamp-3 leading-7 text-muted\">...</p></div></article></div><div class=\"mt-24 border-t border-brand-900/15 pt-14 md:mt-32 md:pt-20\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] lg:gap-20\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-gold\">OUR CULTURE</p></div><div><h3 class=\"max-w-4xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.4] tracking-[-0.03em] text-brand-900 md:text-4xl\">專業不是一個人的表現，<br/><span class=\"text-brand-600\">而是一群人願意一起累積的結果。</span></h3><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-3xl leading-8 text-muted\">我們重視彼此分享經驗、交換觀點，也保留每個人發展自己專業方向的空間。 在這裡，學習不只是課程，而是每天與不同夥伴合作時持續發生的事情。</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"contact\" class=\"bg-brand-900 text-ivory\"><div class=\"container-shell section-space\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 border-b border-white/15 pb-16 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr] lg:gap-20\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold\"></span><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-gold\">JOIN OUR TEAM</p></div><p class=\"mt-6 text-sm leading-7 text-white/50\">Taichung · Taiwan</p></div><div><h2 class=\"max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.04em] md:text-6xl\">下一段職涯，<br/><span class=\"text-brand-200\">也許可以從這裡開始。</span></h2><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-white/60 md:text-lg\">如果你對不動產、財商領域或好天使的團隊文化感興趣， 歡迎進一步認識我們，也歡迎直接與團隊聯絡。</p><div class=\"mt-10\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-between gap-16 bg-brand-200 px-7 py-4 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-brand-900 transition duration-300 hover:bg-ivory\" href=\"/career\"><span>了解加入方式</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2\"><a href=\"tel:0422991391\" class=\"group border-b border-white/15 py-10 md:border-r md:px-8 md:py-12 md:first:pl-0 md:last:border-r-0 md:last:pr-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.22em] text-gold\">PHONE</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-white/40 transition duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:text-brand-200\">↗</span></div><p class=\"mt-6 break-all text-xl font-medium text-white md:text-2xl\">04-2299-1391</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-white/45\">歡迎於服務時間來電與我們聯繫</p></a><a href=\"mailto:Goodangel1013@gmail.com\" class=\"group border-b border-white/15 py-10 md:border-r md:px-8 md:py-12 md:first:pl-0 md:last:border-r-0 md:last:pr-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.22em] text-gold\">EMAIL</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-white/40 transition duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:text-brand-200\">↗</span></div><p class=\"mt-6 break-all text-xl font-medium text-white md:text-2xl\">Goodangel1013@gmail.com</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-white/45\">求職、合作或其他問題皆可來信</p></a></div><div class=\"grid gap-8 border-b border-white/15 py-12 md:grid-cols-[0.35fr_0.65fr] md:py-16\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.22em] text-gold\">OFFICE</p><div><p class=\"text-xl font-medium leading-8 text-white md:text-2xl\">臺中市北屯區文心路四段 61 號</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-white/45\">Taichung City, Taiwan</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 pt-12 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between\"><div><p class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[0.05em] text-white\">好天使</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] text-white/40\">GOOD ANGEL</p></div><p class=\"max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-white/40 md:text-right\">不動產 × 財商 × 人才培育<br/>與願意成長的人，一起走得更遠。</p></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"border-t border-white/10 bg-brand-900 text-ivory\"><div class=\"container-shell\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 py-14 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-start md:py-16\"><div><a class=\"inline-block\" href=\"/\"><p class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-[0.06em] text-white\">好天使</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-white/40\">GOOD ANGEL</p></a><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-white/50\">結合不動產實務、財商教育與人才培育， 與願意學習、願意成長的夥伴一起累積專業。</p></div><nav class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-10 gap-y-4 sm:grid-cols-3 md:text-right\"><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/\">首頁</a><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/about\">認識好天使</a><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/career\">加入好天使</a><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/team\">團隊文化</a><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/contact\">聯絡我們</a></nav></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 border-t border-white/10 py-6 text-[11px] text-white/35 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><p>© 2026 好天使不動產財商團隊</p><p class=\"tracking-[0.16em]\">REAL ESTATE · FINANCE · GROWTH</p></div></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3z5q_p4msz2ha.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[62319,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0hg8jbljd58u-.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[22016,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0hg8jbljd58u-.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n12:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3udo72oo3to5n.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/797e433ab948586e-s.p.0r6juujl39pe6.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/caa3a2e1cccd8315-s.p.0wgildi0cnwt9.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"],\\\"q\\\"